{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcc5 Tuesday, September 16, 2025</strong><br><strong>A New Update Has Arrived: Card Pack Vol.9 \u201cOmochi Chronicle\u201d Now Available!</strong><br>From soothing voices to chaotic blades\u2014<i>VTBattle: It\u2019s Not About Subscribers\u2014Decide It with Strength!</i> brings another exciting expansion to the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This update adds <strong>35 new VTubers</strong>, pushing the total roster to <strong>over 300 unique creators</strong>. And who knows\u2014you might even encounter a hidden character!?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udd95 What's New in Vol.9 \u201cOmochi Chronicle\u201d</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>35 new VTubers</strong> join the fray</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>New card type:</strong> <i>Chaos Edge</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>35 brand-new skills</strong> added to the system</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf80 Choose From Over 300 VTubers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether they\u2019re streamers, singers, illustrators, or ASMR talents, <strong>every single VTuber is fully playable as your main character</strong>.<br>Who will you bring to the battlefield?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139930/extras/b407ff2529ecf91d5ddda422504569bb.avif?t=1772456703\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139930/extras_big/b407ff2529ecf91d5ddda422504569bb.avif?t=1772456703 width=800 height=464 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udce6 Build Your Collection!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>100 playable VTubers</strong>, each with <strong>multiple cards of varying rarities</strong>.<br>Strengthen your favorite creator\u2019s deck and complete their collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Strategic Card Game Meets Auto-Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a team of five cards to boost your stats\u2014<strong>HP, ATK, DEF, MAG, MDEF, SPD</strong>\u2014and challenge tougher opponents as you climb the ranks!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run feels different with roguelike elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outwit your opponents with strategic builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide variety of card effects and abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139930/extras/13cfd1bb47e44ab16b225c7ecd7adcd6.avif?t=1772456703\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139930/extras_big/13cfd1bb47e44ab16b225c7ecd7adcd6.avif?t=1772456703 width=800 height=466 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 Every Card Can Be a Hero</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The strength of a card depends on its <strong>rarity, level, and synergy</strong>, not just the character.<br>Even low-rarity cards can become essential in the right build\u2014<strong>every card matters</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u23f1 Estimated Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single run takes <strong>1\u20132 hours</strong>, perfect for both casual sessions and intense theorycrafting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcfa Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Monetization is allowed<br>\u2705 All scenes can be streamed<br>\u2705 VTBattle may be featured in full in videos or live streams</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdd <i>Note:</i><br>Please be respectful to all participating VTubers. This game features real creators, and we ask for your support and kindness in your content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let us know who your favorite character is\u2014and stay tuned for <strong>upcoming battle features and online modes</strong> in future updates!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"EASY CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139930/df1b8059b2696d0d02ddc879b981f0e43cdb7f32.jpg"},{"name":"NORMAL CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139930/f5fd8a86f6ae29b11a772cb22a6411062bad3a1d.jpg"},{"name":"HARD CLEAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139930/e61b4ac90eac31d9bd1d2c7ca25699edc53b3405.jpg"},{"name":"NORMAL TRUE END","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139930/3d6161ceeb5d60617077e3d4f5d063e8343c5b9c.jpg"},{"name":"HARD TRUE END","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139930/d12f0e3a7c81e24c13d6b9c990260436a0219bf9.jpg"},{"name":"UR Get","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139930/7b72edb7b908e462e668229b1f9c73754dfa6adb.jpg"},{"name":"NORMAL 30 consecutive wins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139930/2822b23534d16537a60e55bf66e69535454b4be1.jpg"},{"name":"HARD 30 consecutive wins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139930/cb2d16ba3c9b2dbd9bab3a96a56c63570b592c9e.jpg"},{"name":"CardPack ArenaGenesis Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139930/5f3f38d3437a769e2d111bf91ff797980894db83.jpg"},{"name":"CarcPack Rock'n Rose Diva Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3139930/bb01fee66582ec08f2b58e2c6bbed2322884ba4d.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3139930?t=1772456703","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3139930?t=1772456703",