hether they\u2019re streamers, singers, illustrators, or ASMR talents, <strong>every single VTuber is fully playable as your main character</strong>.<br>Who will you bring to the battlefield?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139930/extras/b407ff2529ecf91d5ddda422504569bb.avif?t=1772456703\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139930/extras_big/b407ff2529ecf91d5ddda422504569bb.avif?t=1772456703 width=800 height=464 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udce6 Build Your Collection!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>100 playable VTubers</strong>, each with <strong>multiple cards of varying rarities</strong>.<br>Strengthen your favorite creator\u2019s deck and complete their collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Strategic Card Game Meets Auto-Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a team of five cards to boost your stats\u2014<strong>HP, ATK, DEF, MAG, MDEF, SPD</strong>\u2014and challenge tougher opponents as you climb the ranks!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run feels different with roguelike elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outwit your opponents with strategic builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide variety of card effects and abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139930/extras/13cfd1bb47e44ab16b225c7ecd7adcd6.avif?t=1772456703\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139930/extras_big/13cfd1bb47e44ab16b225c7ecd7adcd6.avif?t=1772456703 width=800 height=466 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 Every Card Can Be a Hero</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The strength of a card depends on its <strong>rarity, level, and synergy</strong>, not just the character.<br>Even low-rarity cards can become essential in the right build\u2014<strong>every card matters</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u23f1 Estimated Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single run takes <strong>1\u20132 hours</strong>, perfect for both casual sessions and intense theorycrafting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcfa Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Monetization is allowed<br>\u2705 All scenes can be streamed<br>\u2705 VTBattle may be featured in full in videos or live streams</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdd <i>Note:</i><br>Please be respectful to all participating VTubers. This game features real creators, and we ask for your support and kindness in your content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let us know who your favorite character is\u2014and stay tuned for <strong>upcoming battle features and online modes</strong> in future updates!</p>","developers":["WataritamaStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139930/header.jpg?t=1772456703","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3139930/1864463724/a0a13067ed0d1134eb082775fa9434e4496f1cc7/1758010175/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758010712","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3139930/1864463724/a0a13067ed0d1134eb082775fa9434e4496f1cc7/1758010175/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758010712","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.ste